title "My test game"
font Georgia
color green
"space to start" xl center vcenter / black
music play nyan_cat.mp3
"welcome" xl rightalign left
music stop
"this is the first text" l vcenter center centeralign / #ff0000 sans-serif
bg gray
"and the second text is this" m right leftalign bottom / null monospace
choice "which vial to take?" / "estrogen" estrogen "furry elixir" furry "gay juice" gay / royalblue
jump estrogen
"estrogen chosen" l center vcenter centeralign
"you girl now" l center vcenter centeralign
end estrogen
jump furry
"furry elixir chosen" l center vcenter centeralign
"you grow cat ears and a tail! ^w^" l center vcenter centeralign
end furry
jump gay
"gay juice chosen" l center vcenter centeralign
"you gay now" l center vcenter centeralign
end gay
"fin" xl center vcenter / null monospace